      "message": "Oh wait the goal here just to move it out of non-ganesh code because it has a GR name? If that is the case, I don\u0027t think there is anything special about it being GR and only used with ganesh. I bet we could just change all GR_TEST_UTILS macros to be GPU_TEST_UTILS instead. If there are any cases that were actually using it to be \"are we running our tests and are in ganesh\" then we can just add the `\u0026\u0026 defined(SK_GANESH)`. Having just one global GPU_TEST_UTILS define seems better anyways.",
